---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Free Invoice Generator" description="Our privacy policy. We do not store your data.">
  <Navbar />
  
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 mb-8">Last Updated: September 16, 2026</p>
    
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy outlines how we handle your information. The short version is simple: <strong>we do not collect, store, or analyze your invoice data on our servers.</strong>
      </p>

      <h3>100% Client-Side Processing</h3>
      <p>
        Our tool runs entirely within your web browser. When you generate an invoice, all financial data, client names, and business details remain strictly on your local device. No data is sent to our servers.
      </p>

      <h3>Cookies and Analytics</h3>
      <p>
        We do not use tracking cookies. We may use anonymous, privacy-friendly analytics to count page views, but we do not track your individual behavior or store personally identifiable information. We may use your browser's local storage to save your preferences (like your chosen currency) so you don't have to re-enter them every time.
      </p>

      <h3>Contact Us</h3>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at: <a href="mailto:support@yourdomain.com">support@yourdomain.com</a>.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12">
        <a href="/" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">&larr; Back to the Invoice Generator</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
